.git
.logs
data
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
frontend/dist
backend/data
**/.env
*.md

# The vendored Pi tree is verified byte-for-byte against pi-source.lock.json
# during the image build, so no general-purpose ignore rule may remove
# anything from it. Re-include everything under runtime/, then drop only its
# installed dependencies.
!runtime/**
runtime/node_modules

runtime/.cache/pi-build-generation-*
runtime/.cache/pi-build-current.json
